{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/routing/hash-location","title":"Fixed URL routing with hashes","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"fixed-url-routing-with-hashes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fixed URL routing with hashes"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"withHashLocation()"},{"t":"text","text":" when a client application must stay at the same"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"browser path and the static host only serves "},{"t":"code","text":"/"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideCraftRouter, withHashLocation } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"provideCraftRouter","kind":"function"},{"text":"(appRoutes.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toRoutes","kind":"function"},{"text":"(), ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"withHashLocation","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The router stores its path, query parameters and fragment after the first "},{"t":"code","text":"#"},{"t":"text","text":":"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"/#/products/42?page=2#details"},{"t":"text","text":". Route declarations, typed params and query"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"params stay the same. Links, navigation, redirects, active-link checks and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"browser history use the selected strategy. "},{"t":"code","text":"navigateByUrl"},{"t":"text","text":" accepts both an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"internal URL such as "},{"t":"code","text":"/products/42?page=2"},{"t":"text","text":" and its hash form."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Path routing remains the default. Hash routing is for client-rendered apps:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the browser does not send the fragment to the server, so SSR cannot choose a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"route from it."}]}],"outline":[]}